   "data": {
    "name": "The Crown in the Surf",
    "description": "A quiet stretch of Tidewatch Beach has been closed after luminous jellyfish began washing into the shallows. Clear the water, then find what is driving the swarm toward shore.",
    "successDescription": "The Royal Jellyfish retreats beyond the breakers, and the scattered swarm drifts back out to sea. Tidewatch Beach is safe again.",
    "questType": "event",
    "tierLevel": null,
    "maxAttempts": 1,
    "maxCompletes": 1,
    "retryDelay": "none",
    "attemptDelay": "none",
    "consecutiveObjectives": true,
    "startsAt": null,
    "endsAt": null,
    "content": {
     "objectives": [
      {
       "task": "dialog",
       "image": "",
       "description": "<i>Morning light flashes across Tidewatch Beach, but the usual fishing skiffs are pulled high above the tide line. A warning rope cuts across the path to the water.</i> <br> <br> Overnight, luminous jellyfish drifted into the shallows and drove everyone off the beach. The assignment on the weathered patrol board is simple: clear the water and determine why the swarm came ashore.",
       "successDescription": "",
       "sceneBackground": "Pz52vtn130CkDPjUjhPvN",
       "sceneCharacters": [],
       "attackers": [],
       "attackers_scale_gains": 1,
       "attackers_max_per_battle": 1,
       "id": "jelly_o0",
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "Step onto the beach.",
         "nextObjectiveId": "jelly_o1"
        }
       ],
       "attackers_scaled_to_user": false
      },
      {
       "task": "dialog",
       "image": "",
       "description": "<i>The next wave leaves a cold blue glow behind it. A jellyfish rises from the foam, its bell pulsing above the surface while thin tendrils drag across the wet sand.</i> <br> <br> More lights drift farther out, but this one holds the shallows as if guarding the way seaward.",
       "successDescription": "",
       "sceneBackground": "Pz52vtn130CkDPjUjhPvN",
       "sceneCharacters": [],
       "attackers": [],
       "attackers_scale_gains": 1,
       "attackers_max_per_battle": 1,
       "id": "jelly_o1",
       "nextObjectiveId": [
        {
         "text": "Clear the shallows.",
         "nextObjectiveId": "jelly_b1"
        }
       ],
       "attackers_scaled_to_user": false
      },
      {
       "task": "start_battle",
       "opponentAIs": [
        {
         "ids": [
          "@ai:jelly_ai_basic"
         ],
         "number": 1,
         "quantity": 1
        }
       ],
       "description": "",
       "successDescription": "",
       "sceneBackground": "Pz52vtn130CkDPjUjhPvN",
       "sceneCharacters": [],
       "completionOutcome": "Win",
