      },
      {
       "task": "dialog",
       "image": "",
       "description": "<i>The jellyfish collapses into the receding foam. At once, the scattered lights beyond the breakers begin moving together.</i> <br> <br> The water darkens beneath a broad shadow. A much larger bell rises offshore, edged in bright points like a crown. The smaller jellyfish were not simply washing ashore. They were following it.",
       "successDescription": "",
       "sceneBackground": "Pz52vtn130CkDPjUjhPvN",
       "sceneCharacters": [],
       "attackers": [],
       "attackers_scale_gains": 1,
